### PASO 9: Simular envío de datos desde Arduino
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/lectura
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "rpm": 450.5,
    "kg_procesados": 3.72,
    "kg_hora": 22.3,
    "temperatura": 38.1,
    "estado_motor": "ON",
    "sesion_id": "SES-20241015-001"
}

